5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I believe we need to be very careful about the financial distribution this year. I'll look into the quoting terms for whole-building lets and the group transport in three years of receipts.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shion,,I'll focus on the actual experience of the members. I'm going to look into the accounts from two clubs that went inland and the prefecture rate sheet for publicly run beds.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,"I want to make sure everyone has a good time and no one is too tired. I'll look into the canteen closure and last year's cooking duty, and what the seniors say about year-groups mixing.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
